   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tonga Chamber of Commerce and Industry (TCCI) aims to provide strong and effective representatives of the private sector and its contribution to social and economic development. It delivers a range of services and assistance to member companies large and small that assist enterprises firms in navigating the rapidly changing world of work. This biennium the support has been provided to build the Chamber&apos;s technical capacities for policy engagement on skills development and labour moblity.</narrative>
  </description>
